+/- Counterfactual 3: hard-coding integer payloads violates injectivity. -/
+private def hardCodedIntBridge : SortNumSeq → SortValSeq
+  | SortNumSeq.«.NumSeq_VERIFICATION-SYNTAX_NumSeq» => emptyValSeq
